00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:36.590
information is sufficient and secure.

00:01:36.590 --> 00:01:41.430
Those are distinctions I will explain using the actual methods.

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:48.910
My intended use case is tracking networking equipment and technical supplies.

00:01:48.910 --> 00:01:55.430
So after I joined the military, I noticed that the supply chain was pretty poorly ran,

00:01:55.430 --> 00:02:00.630
